OL,3,ACatherine talks openly about how cancer
OL,4,Achanged her in documentary on BBC
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Princess of Wales has spoken about
OL,7,Fhow "cancer does change you," in a
OL,8,Fforthcoming documentary called Heal to
OL,9,Fbe shown on the BBC.
OL,11,F"It changes your body, it changes you
OL,12,Fphysically - but there is a much, much
OL,13,Fdeeper part to what a cancer diagnosis
OL,14,Fshifts in you," says Catherine in the
OL,15,Ffirst glimpses from the documentary,
OL,16,Fwhich features her private thoughts on
OL,17,Fher illness and recovery.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/39
