OL,3,ADeal with EU not dependent on tuition
OL,4,Afees agreement, Miliband says
OL,5,
OL,6,FEuropean Commission President Ursula
OL,7,Fvon der Leyen said she was "confident"
OL,8,Fa solution would be found, with Prime
OL,9,FMinister Andy Burnham adding "me too"
OL,10,Fduring a press conference announcing
OL,11,Fthe deal.
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
