OL,3,ASuffolk village votes to 'leave the UK'
OL,4,Aover plan to house migrants at former
OL,5,Amilitary base
OL,6,
OL,7,FResidents of Barnham, Suffolk have
OL,8,Foverwhelmingly voted to "leave the UK"
OL,9,Fin a symbolic referendum
OL,11,FThe result was announced after about 30
OL,12,Fminutes of counting, with 257 votes
OL,13,Fcast in favour of leaving while 16
OL,14,Fpeople voted against
OL,16,FMany locals had been angry at
OL,17,Fgovernment proposals to house asylum
OL,18,Fseekers at a former military base,
OL,19,Fwhich was the scene of protests outside
OL,20,Fwhen news of the plan emerged
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,305,300,200,140,0,100
