OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ASuffolk village votes to 'leave the UK'
OL,4,Aover plan to house migrants at former
OL,5,Amilitary base
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe Home Office, which insists it has
OL,8,Fbeen listening to villagers' concerns,
OL,9,Fsays about 930 men could be placed at
OL,10,FRAF Barnham
OL,12,FFollowing the result, residents
OL,13,Funveiled a flag to celebrate the
OL,14,Fvillage's newfound "independence"
OL,16,FBarnham is the second village to hold a
OL,17,Fsymbolic poll over migrant housing
OL,18,Fplans, after residents of Piddington in
OL,19,FOxfordshire voted to leave the UK in
OL,20,FSeptember
OL,23,APub: 21-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/39
